# Host functions the guest imports (declared in
# port/switch/guest/guest_host.h, defined in port/switch/host). The
# generated hostgl_* GL entry points (build/switch/gen/gl_imports.list,
# from tools/android_gl_stubs.py - gl.h's Android list is reused as-is,
# same GLES3.2 API, same devkitPro headers) are merged with this list by
# tools/android_imports.py, which both generators come from unmodified -
# see PORTING.md's "unstub video" milestone.
